    level: "B1",
    title_kr: "혼자 이사를 준비하며 배운 것",
    title_en: "What I learned while preparing to move alone",
    body_kr: "처음으로 가족의 도움 없이 혼자 이사를 준비하게 됐다. 짐을 싸는 것부터 계약서를 확인하는 것까지 모든 게 낯설고 어려웠다. 인터넷으로 정보를 찾아가며 하나씩 배워 나갔다. 이사 업체를 고를 때는 몇 군데를 비교해 보고 신중하게 결정했다. 예상보다 많은 서류와 절차가 필요해서 며칠 동안 정신이 없었다. 이사 당일에는 예상치 못한 문제도 생겼지만 침착하게 하나씩 해결했다. 모든 짐이 정리된 새집을 보며 뿌듯한 마음이 들었다. 이번 경험을 통해 스스로 무언가를 해낼 수 있다는 자신감이 생겼다.",
    body_en: "For the first time, I had to prepare for a move entirely on my own, without family help. From packing to checking the lease contract, everything felt unfamiliar and difficult. I searched for information online and learned things one by one. When choosing a moving company, I compared several options and decided carefully. There were more documents and procedures required than expected, so I was overwhelmed for several days. On moving day, unexpected problems came up, but I calmly resolved them one by one. Looking at the new home with everything organized, I felt a sense of pride. Through this experience, I gained confidence that I could accomplish things on my own.",
    questions: [
      { question_en: "How did the narrator choose a moving company?", options: ["Picked the first one found","Compared several options carefully","Used the same one as before","Asked family to choose"], answerIndex: 1 },
      { question_en: "What did the narrator gain from this experience?", options: ["Financial loss","Confidence in handling things alone","Regret","A dislike of moving"], answerIndex: 1 },
    ],
